  "paraphrase": "Combining royalty and spirituality, Princess Märtha Louise of Norway, daughter of King Harald, married shaman Durek Verrett in a non-traditional ceremony.  The wedding took place in Geiranger, Norway, drawing onlookers eager to see the bride. Fourth in line to the throne at age 52, Princess Märtha Louise wed the 49-year-old Verrett in a traditional church ceremony at the Hotel Union. The wedding had a traditional feel with bridesmaids, including her daughters from a previous marriage, and featured a guest list of 350 that included prominent royals like her brother, Crown Prince Haakon, and royals from other countries. Princess Märtha Louise has lived a different life than most, having identified as clairvoyant and operated a healing school that taught people how to connect with angels.  She chose to step back from royal duties in 2022 to concentrate on her and Verrett's shared business interests. Verrett, who claims to be a \"servant of God\" and \"energy activator,\" has high-profile clients like Gwyneth Paltrow, whom he calls a \"soul sister.\""
}
